  "description": "Paid checks for AI agents before they touch a token or a wallet on Base or Ethereum: a token risk check (honeypot, taxes, owner powers, top holders, liquidity, 0 to 100 score), a wallet summary (ETH and USDC balances, activity, EOA or contract, reputation flags) and a machine readable market brief. USDC per call over x402 on Base. Heuristics from public data, not an audit and not financial advice.",
